cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "WW3 GPU Lab: agentic coding and agentic research on a bit-for-bit GPU port of WAVEWATCH III"
abstract: >-
  A book in progress on agentic coding and agentic research, compiled from the repository
  that is its evidence, written around one problem: moving the expensive kernels of the
  WAVEWATCH III spectral wind-wave model to GPUs without changing the answer. Sixteen
  lessons take the reader from the wave spectrum to running the Fortran model on real
  cases, benchmarking it, and porting its kernels (starting with the W3SNL1 nonlinear
  interaction source term) to C++/Kokkos with coding agents under a bit-for-bit parity
  harness against the Fortran reference; the plans, decisions and measurements carry
  their evidence and the command that reproduces each number.
